WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.440
The shining time...

00:08.610 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.250
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.340 --> 00:38.640
I can sense it.

00:39.810 --> 00:46.940
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.190 --> 00:54.860
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.740 --> 01:01.870
You've run so far.

01:02.950 --> 01:10.130
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.340 --> 01:16.340
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.640
my stolen heart beats.

01:40.330 --> 01:44.870
Hey, hey! How's this dress compared to that other one?

01:44.870 --> 01:46.160
You still want to buy more?

01:46.160 --> 01:48.540
I don't want to go out in old clothes.

01:48.540 --> 01:50.170
Geez...

01:50.170 --> 01:52.670
But this skirt's pretty.

01:52.670 --> 01:54.670
You want to buy more, too.

01:54.670 --> 01:57.590
Should I buy it...?

01:57.590 --> 02:00.090
Hey, look, look! This outfit is adorable!!

02:00.090 --> 02:02.970
Hey! There's more cute stuff over there!

02:02.970 --> 02:04.180
Let's go, let's go!

02:04.180 --> 02:06.430
Maron, how does this look?

02:06.430 --> 02:09.400
Miyako, you're so bold!

02:09.400 --> 02:13.360
I was only kidding. This looks good.

02:13.360 --> 02:15.280
Isn't that a little tacky?

02:15.280 --> 02:19.200
- What?! Don't be so picky.

02:17.990 --> 02:19.200
- Who cares?

02:19.200 --> 02:21.660
This is getting us nowhere.

02:22.370 --> 02:24.240
But this looks so good...

02:26.700 --> 02:27.500
Huh...?

02:27.960 --> 02:28.960
That's the Class President, isn't it?!

02:29.330 --> 02:31.040
What are you doing here...?

02:31.290 --> 02:34.840
I wanted to ask Maron-san out on a date!

02:36.090 --> 02:36.960
A date...?

02:37.170 --> 02:38.300
Me...?

02:38.720 --> 02:39.470
tomorrow...

02:39.800 --> 02:41.180
...the play...

02:41.180 --> 02:43.550
... "Romeo and Juilet" is playing.

02:43.930 --> 02:44.850
Do you know about it?

02:45.060 --> 02:45.930
Of course!

02:46.180 --> 02:47.930
Two popular stars...

02:47.930 --> 02:50.440
...Matsubara Saki and Ootomo Masahide star in it.

02:50.650 --> 02:55.440
I heard it's nearly impossible to get tickets!!

02:55.690 --> 02:56.780
What about i--

02:58.440 --> 02:59.820
Class President, could it be that you...?!

03:00.240 --> 03:00.700
Yes.

03:00.950 --> 03:04.620
I have two tickets.

03:04.830 --> 03:05.830
Would you like to go out with me?

03:06.830 --> 03:07.790
I'm so happy!

03:08.160 --> 03:09.790
Thank you, Class President.

03:10.160 --> 03:10.790
Um...

03:11.000 --> 03:12.000
Class President...

03:12.380 --> 03:14.380
Until now, I've kept it to myself.

03:14.790 --> 03:17.090
But, Class President, I love...

03:17.210 --> 03:18.760
It's okay, Maron-san.

03:19.090 --> 03:20.760
You don't need to say it...

03:21.090 --> 03:23.340
I've known from the beginning...

03:23.340 --> 03:24.300
Class President...

03:24.550 --> 03:25.510
Maron-san...

03:26.680 --> 03:30.390
Perfect! That's the way to go, Minazuki Yamato!

03:31.060 --> 03:33.560
Huh? That's the Class President, isn't it?

03:33.560 --> 03:35.270
What are you doing here?

03:35.270 --> 03:38.980
I...I...well... I wanted to...

03:38.980 --> 03:41.360
Ah! Tickets for "Romeo and Juliet!"

03:41.360 --> 03:44.280
Um... I wanted to...

03:44.280 --> 03:47.490
So you're going too, Class President?

03:47.490 --> 03:50.750
Huh? "I'm going...too...?"

03:50.750 --> 03:53.960
We're going, right, Miyako?

03:53.960 --> 03:56.380
That's why we were shopping.

03:56.380 --> 03:58.800
We have to wear something appropriate.

03:58.800 --> 04:00.920
I'm really excited about tomorrow!

04:04.890 --> 04:06.300
Who are you going with, Class President?

04:06.300 --> 04:07.390
Huh?

04:07.390 --> 04:09.890
Well, you have two tickets.

04:09.890 --> 04:12.690
Uh, that is...

04:16.310 --> 04:17.900
Oh, wait!

04:21.280 --> 04:23.240
Oh, what's this?

04:24.070 --> 04:30.750
The Pin Is Mightier than the Sword!

04:30.750 --> 04:40.510
Engagement!?

04:30.750 --> 04:40.510
Ootomo Mashide

04:30.750 --> 04:40.510
Matsubara Saki

04:31.160 --> 04:35.000
Yes. I'm the most excited one in the cast.

04:35.000 --> 04:36.790
Huh? What's this?

04:37.460 --> 04:40.500
The person I love gave it to me. It's a good luck charm.

04:40.500 --> 04:44.880
Hmm... The Romeo and Juliet play...

04:44.880 --> 04:49.970
Don't go if you don't want to. The Class President is not forcing you to go.

04:49.970 --> 04:52.680
I'm talking about the story of the play.

04:52.680 --> 04:54.190
What do you mean?

04:54.190 --> 04:58.480
The play takes place in a one-week time frame, right?

04:58.480 --> 05:05.780
During that time, they meet, fall in love, decide to marry, fail, and end up dying.

05:05.780 --> 05:07.360
Doesn't sound too good...

05:07.360 --> 05:11.790
How can you say that about Shakespeare's classic tragedy?

05:11.790 --> 05:16.790
Tragedy, huh? Seems like an immature tragedy to me.

05:16.790 --> 05:19.790
Love is only a misunderstanding of feelings.

05:20.380 --> 05:25.380
It's better than being so arrogant like Chiaki.

05:25.380 --> 05:30.100
Then you're experienced in the matters of love?

05:30.100 --> 05:33.890
Why do I have to tell you anything?

05:33.890 --> 05:35.890
- I don't know what you're talking about!

05:35.890 --> 05:36.890
Huh?

05:36.890 --> 05:39.690
If you don't want to, just say no!

05:39.690 --> 05:41.690
Say something!

05:41.690 --> 05:43.570
I can't believe it!!!

05:43.570 --> 05:46.700
It's Ootomo Masahide and Matsubara Saki!

05:46.700 --> 05:49.070
I can't believe they're fighting.

05:49.070 --> 05:52.870
It was rumored that they were in love and engaged to be married...

05:52.870 --> 05:55.160
In love? Them?

05:55.160 --> 05:58.000
Tell me what you dont like about me!

06:00.080 --> 06:03.460
It's not like you'll change if I tell you.

06:03.460 --> 06:05.630
It's too late now.

06:05.630 --> 06:08.090
- Just a little too late.

06:06.590 --> 06:08.090
- Just wait a minute!

06:12.010 --> 06:14.270
We're through!

06:14.810 --> 06:18.390
How mean! What kind of guy is that?!

06:20.400 --> 06:23.400
What's that "beep beep" noise, Maron?

06:23.400 --> 06:24.980
Oh, sorry.

06:25.690 --> 06:27.990
<i>The Petit Claire is reacting to a Demon...</i>

06:31.990 --> 06:33.160
Masahide!

06:39.000 --> 06:42.290
We're sorry! We, um, we were just...!

06:43.960 --> 06:45.050
How exasperating.

06:45.050 --> 06:46.170
Huh?

06:47.670 --> 06:50.760
Really? You're all coming to see my play?

06:50.760 --> 06:53.890
Yes, we're really excited about it!

06:53.890 --> 06:57.980
I'm so glad. I'll do my best, so please watch me.

06:57.980 --> 06:58.640
Thank you.

07:00.190 --> 07:02.560
But, Matsubara-san...

07:02.560 --> 07:03.400
Hmm?

07:03.400 --> 07:08.070
...you're more cheerful than I thought you would be.

07:08.070 --> 07:11.860
Hey! You want to say that I'm too childish, don't you?

07:11.860 --> 07:14.370
Oh, no... of course not.

07:14.370 --> 07:15.490
It's okay.

07:15.490 --> 07:17.910
I'm told that a lot.

07:17.910 --> 07:21.870
That's probably why Masahide and I fight so much.

07:21.870 --> 07:23.670
I'm tired of it.

07:23.670 --> 07:25.170
Saki-san, I found it.

07:25.170 --> 07:26.380
Oh, thank you!

07:26.960 --> 07:30.550
But, was it like that before?

07:32.590 --> 07:37.220
<i>Yeah, I really wanted to star in it just once.</i>

07:39.890 --> 07:43.400
I think he's just tired of me because I'm not very good.

07:43.400 --> 07:45.560
Not very good in what way?

07:45.560 --> 07:46.900
My Juliet.

07:46.900 --> 07:47.900
Eh?

07:47.900 --> 07:51.990
Really, I think it's pretty bad.

07:51.990 --> 07:55.370
His personality changed when we started practicing.

07:57.580 --> 08:00.370
Oh no! I've got to practice!

08:00.370 --> 08:03.620
Um... two, four...

08:04.290 --> 08:06.170
Are they all there?

08:06.170 --> 08:07.960
Um, no... I'm still missing one...

08:08.920 --> 08:10.630
It's okay. Don't worry.

08:10.630 --> 08:15.090
I don't care. Practice is more important than pearls.

08:15.090 --> 08:16.470
Thanks, everyone.

08:16.470 --> 08:17.100
No!

08:17.100 --> 08:17.890
Eh?

08:17.890 --> 08:24.270
Uh, um, you got that necklace from your love, right?

08:24.270 --> 08:27.060
Uh, yeah... But it's okay...

08:27.060 --> 08:31.280
We can find it if we look harder! Don't give up!

08:31.280 --> 08:32.860
Because...

08:32.860 --> 08:36.490
We'll look for it for you!

08:36.490 --> 08:39.280
Eh? No, you don't have to.

08:39.280 --> 08:41.910
In exchange, do your best in the play!

08:42.500 --> 08:44.790
I understand. I promise I will.

08:44.790 --> 08:47.580
I'll be the <i>best </i>Juliet ever!

08:48.590 --> 08:51.670
After all that looking, we couldn't find it.

08:51.670 --> 08:53.340
I'm going to try again tomorrow.

08:55.090 --> 08:56.090
What's wrong?

08:56.090 --> 09:01.680
I seldom see Maron this serious.

09:01.680 --> 09:04.100
I'm not being serious.

09:04.100 --> 09:06.190
When they break up, they break up.

09:06.190 --> 09:07.980
When it ends, it ends.

09:07.980 --> 09:09.570
Just leave them alone.

09:09.570 --> 09:11.070
Nagoya-kun!

09:11.070 --> 09:13.360
That's <i>fate</i>, isn't it?

09:13.360 --> 09:16.860
Don't use "fate" so easily!

09:16.860 --> 09:20.870
Even if they're destined to meet, the rest of it is in their power!

09:20.870 --> 09:24.290
There are couples that break up, no matter what.

09:24.290 --> 09:26.500
Those two won't break up!

09:26.500 --> 09:29.170
You don't really know that. That's only wishful thinking.

09:31.090 --> 09:32.090
Maron!

09:47.900 --> 09:49.190
Oh, Romeo!

09:50.980 --> 09:53.150
Poison, I see, hath been his timeless end.

09:55.360 --> 09:59.870
O churl! Drunk all and left no friendly drop to help me after!

10:00.990 --> 10:04.660
That's enough! That's it for today.

10:04.660 --> 10:07.500
Good job!

10:11.880 --> 10:13.090
I'm sorry!

10:13.090 --> 10:14.170
Don't touch it!

10:19.380 --> 10:23.100
It's my sword. Don't touch it.

10:27.890 --> 10:29.390
It's just as I thought!

10:30.270 --> 10:32.190
It's exactly like Maron said it would be.

10:32.190 --> 10:34.820
There's a Demon in that sword!

10:35.690 --> 10:37.490
If separating is "fate..."

10:37.490 --> 10:39.030
...then why do people meet?

10:39.780 --> 10:41.780
I don't understand.

10:41.780 --> 10:43.490
I'm home!

10:43.490 --> 10:45.910
Maron, you were right about the sword!

10:45.910 --> 10:48.580
He always keeps the sword by his side.

10:48.580 --> 10:51.880
However, there is a scene where he has to draw the sword.

10:51.880 --> 10:52.420
Really?

10:52.420 --> 10:56.300
Yes. That will be the time to <i>Checkmate!</i>

10:56.300 --> 10:57.170
I can't.

10:57.170 --> 10:58.170
Why not?

10:58.170 --> 11:01.470
Then the whole play would be ruined.

11:01.470 --> 11:04.390
Don't you want to help him?

11:04.390 --> 11:06.970
Besides, I've already sent the notice card.

11:08.680 --> 11:13.980
<i>"Tomorrow, I will steal the brightness of Romeo's sword." - Kaitou Jeanne</i>

11:14.400 --> 11:16.570
Um, sir? Can I go now?

11:16.570 --> 11:19.190
Yes, it's all right.

11:19.190 --> 11:24.780
Don't worry. We won't let anyone disturb the play.

11:24.780 --> 11:25.780
Um...

11:25.780 --> 11:26.580
Hmm?

11:26.580 --> 11:29.290
You have more questions?

11:29.290 --> 11:31.000
No, it's not that...

11:31.000 --> 11:32.080
Your back...

11:32.080 --> 11:33.380
My back?

11:34.340 --> 11:37.000
<i>I will take the brightness of Romeo's sword from Kaitou Jeanne. - Kaitou Sinbad</i>

11:37.340 --> 11:39.920
Notice

11:37.340 --> 11:39.920
Don't go away!

11:37.340 --> 11:39.920
I'll return right after these messages!

11:37.340 --> 11:39.920
Kaitou Jeanne

11:40.840 --> 11:43.470
Notice

11:40.840 --> 11:43.470
I'm back to continue my adventures

11:40.840 --> 11:43.470
Kaitou Jeanne

11:43.970 --> 11:47.010
Why can't you watch the play with everyone?

11:47.010 --> 11:49.770
A notice arrived from Jeanne.

11:49.770 --> 11:51.390
Just as I thought!

11:51.390 --> 11:53.270
What do you mean by "Just as I thought?!

11:53.270 --> 11:55.270
Well, that...

11:55.270 --> 11:55.770
Huh?

12:00.280 --> 12:01.780
All right, next!

12:05.370 --> 12:06.030
All right!

12:06.030 --> 12:09.660
Geez, that's so obvious...

12:09.660 --> 12:13.790
And it's not only Jeanne but Sinbad, too.

12:13.790 --> 12:16.080
Oh, that sounds like trouble.

12:16.080 --> 12:17.880
What's wrong with you?

12:17.880 --> 12:20.170
Don't try to start a fight with me.

12:20.170 --> 12:23.880
Oh, are you interested in what I have to say?

12:23.880 --> 12:24.510
Who would be?

12:26.890 --> 12:28.390
It's five minutes 'til the curtain goes up.

12:28.390 --> 12:29.600
I have to go.

12:29.600 --> 12:31.770
I'm really sorry, Maron!

12:31.770 --> 12:33.890
Oh it's okay, Miyako.

12:33.890 --> 12:36.480
If you're going up against Jeanne, it's unavoidable.

12:36.480 --> 12:39.270
It's a good chance to get along with Chiaki.

12:39.270 --> 12:40.400
What?!

12:46.990 --> 12:49.990
This is Akita. I'm in position now.

13:01.380 --> 13:03.300
"Who's there?"

13:03.300 --> 13:05.380
"Hey, there's a man lying on the ground!"

13:05.380 --> 13:11.890
- Hey, shut up! I'm trying to memorize my lines!

13:09.680 --> 13:11.890
- What was that? You too, dumbass!

13:11.890 --> 13:15.390
- Well, excuse me!

13:14.180 --> 13:15.390
- What did you say?!

13:15.390 --> 13:18.650
Get that dirty face away from me!

13:19.270 --> 13:22.070
I won't allow any mistakes.

13:22.070 --> 13:24.190
What? Practice...?

13:24.190 --> 13:29.030
You idiots! Put your energy into arresting Jeanne!

13:31.700 --> 13:34.290
It's almost time, right, Nagoya-kun?

13:34.290 --> 13:36.580
Huh? Did he go to the restroom?

13:40.590 --> 13:42.090
You <i>do</i> understand, don't you, Maron?

13:42.090 --> 13:44.300
The only chance is during the battle scene!

14:14.370 --> 14:16.200
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

14:19.170 --> 14:20.830
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

14:21.790 --> 14:23.500
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

14:37.980 --> 14:41.360
What lady is that, which doth enrich the hand of yonder knight?

14:50.280 --> 14:53.080
Oh Romeo, Romeo!

14:53.080 --> 14:55.990
Wherefore art thou, Romeo?

14:55.990 --> 14:58.500
Oh, what man art thou?

14:58.500 --> 15:01.000
It is me, Romeo!

15:01.000 --> 15:02.500
Oh, my lovely Romeo.

15:08.090 --> 15:10.180
Aren't you ready yet, Sinbad?

15:10.180 --> 15:12.680
Let's just finish it and go home.

15:12.680 --> 15:14.390
Wait a little more.

15:14.390 --> 15:15.760
A little more?

15:15.760 --> 15:17.600
Until the battle scene.

15:17.600 --> 15:19.980
Romeo, the hate I bear thee can afford no better term than this: thou art a villain!

15:19.980 --> 15:23.230
Villain I am none. Therefore, farewell; I see thou know'st me not.

15:23.980 --> 15:25.190
Turn and draw!

15:25.190 --> 15:25.900
What?!

15:25.900 --> 15:26.650
Stop!

15:27.980 --> 15:30.110
If thou hast no will to fight, then die!

15:32.490 --> 15:33.700
It's started.

15:34.780 --> 15:35.780
Stop!

15:35.780 --> 15:36.490
Mercutio!

15:55.600 --> 15:56.430
Now.

16:11.280 --> 16:13.490
Stay out of my way, Sinbad!

16:14.360 --> 16:19.790
Jeanne, you arrive late and then you want to order <i>me</i> around?

16:19.790 --> 16:20.790
That's right.

16:22.000 --> 16:23.040
Then...

16:24.500 --> 16:25.670
...I won't hold back!

16:34.090 --> 16:37.300
Hurry up, Jeanne! The battle's about to end!

16:38.600 --> 16:41.480
I know... I'll end it!

16:58.280 --> 17:01.200
You're going after the Demon, right?

17:01.200 --> 17:02.290
That's right.

17:02.290 --> 17:04.580
Then why don't you <i>Checkmate</i> it?

17:04.580 --> 17:09.130
I'll <i>Checkmate</i> it as soon as I get rid of you!

17:30.690 --> 17:34.570
What have I done? O, I am fortune's fool!

17:34.570 --> 17:36.280
Romeo, away, be gone!

17:38.990 --> 17:41.370
Is the play that important?

17:41.370 --> 17:42.490
Yes, it is.

17:42.490 --> 17:43.750
Why?

17:43.750 --> 17:46.500
Because it's something that people put their souls into.

17:46.500 --> 17:48.000
That's stupid.

17:48.000 --> 17:50.170
There are those who believe in love.

17:50.170 --> 17:52.500
Jeanne, are you talking about yourself?

17:52.500 --> 17:54.800
The battle scene's over!

17:54.800 --> 17:58.180
The final scene will be your only other chance, Jeanne!

17:58.180 --> 18:03.270
Romeo, I come! This do I drink to thee.

18:03.270 --> 18:06.180
I shall wake before the time that Romeo come to redeem me.

18:16.280 --> 18:17.700
I don't understand.

18:17.700 --> 18:19.280
You don't understand?

18:19.280 --> 18:22.490
How one can have such strong feelings for someone?

18:22.490 --> 18:24.290
I don't understand.

18:27.370 --> 18:30.460
That's what you call... vulnerable!

18:39.470 --> 18:40.470
Shit!

18:42.970 --> 18:45.100
That's... Sinbad's...

18:46.100 --> 18:47.100
Jeanne!

18:47.480 --> 18:49.980
Dad, Jeanne and Sinbad are here!

18:50.900 --> 18:52.270
Dad...?

18:52.270 --> 18:55.980
Juliet! Poor Juliet!!!

18:55.980 --> 18:58.780
Natsuda-san, Fuyuta-san... Jeanne has appeared!

18:59.490 --> 19:02.280
Natsuda-san! Please respond!

19:02.280 --> 19:03.580
Fuyuta-san!

19:04.780 --> 19:06.370
Where are you?

19:06.370 --> 19:08.500
Jeanne has appeared!

19:08.500 --> 19:11.670
Damn it! Akita-san!

19:11.670 --> 19:14.170
Jeanne and Sinbad are RIGHT ABOVE YOU!!!

19:14.170 --> 19:17.880
You should be able to see them from there! Check it out!

19:17.880 --> 19:23.800
Akita-san! Akita-san! Damn it, everyone! What's going on with all of you?!

19:25.600 --> 19:28.100
Crap. Sinbad, they've noticed us!

19:28.100 --> 19:29.770
You win this time.

19:31.600 --> 19:34.270
- Why did you have to die?

19:34.270 --> 19:37.190
- Why do I have to live?

19:37.190 --> 19:38.240
- Why?

19:45.080 --> 19:46.370
Oh, Romeo!

19:49.580 --> 19:51.920
Poison, I see, hath been his timeless end.

19:55.290 --> 19:59.800
O churl! Drunk all and left no friendly drop to help me after!

20:03.390 --> 20:06.560
O happy dagger! There rust, and let me die!

20:06.560 --> 20:08.390
<i>Checkmate!</i>

20:16.900 --> 20:17.820
Way to go!

20:21.070 --> 20:22.070
The sword...

20:22.070 --> 20:23.070
...disappeared...

20:23.070 --> 20:25.870
Then Juliet can't die!

20:25.870 --> 20:27.580
Is this how it should be?

20:30.790 --> 20:33.210
Something penetrated my heart!

20:34.370 --> 20:35.790
A sword?

20:36.290 --> 20:38.040
No, it was the light!

20:40.090 --> 20:43.970
If death is fated, then living on is a duty.

20:43.970 --> 20:48.430
If meeting is Heaven's doing, then separation is what people choose.

20:49.470 --> 20:51.770
I have committed a sin.

20:51.770 --> 20:54.690
A sin of running, a sin of closing my eyes to all.

20:55.600 --> 20:58.270
Why didn't I confront my problems?

20:58.980 --> 21:04.610
I... I have to make up for this sin with my life...

21:04.610 --> 21:06.490
By living through it!

21:19.000 --> 21:21.500
That play was really good.

21:21.500 --> 21:24.090
But you lost against Jeanne.

21:24.090 --> 21:28.390
Hey, don't remind me when I'm in a good mood!

21:28.390 --> 21:29.550
I'm sorry.

21:29.550 --> 21:32.180
Well, I am mad.

21:32.180 --> 21:35.100
But the play was really good.

21:35.100 --> 21:38.610
But why did they change the ending?

21:38.610 --> 21:39.810
Because no one liked it.

21:41.980 --> 21:44.240
Because it's better to live on than to die.

21:57.000 --> 22:00.000
Precious person

21:57.000 --> 22:00.000
Destined person

21:57.000 --> 22:00.000
Surprising entry in family register!!

21:57.000 --> 22:00.000
Masahide & Saki

21:57.580 --> 22:00.000
It's from Chiaki.

22:03.590 --> 22:04.970
What an idiot....

22:05.470 --> 22:11.300
For billions of years,

22:11.390 --> 22:20.860
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:23.020 --> 22:29.490
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.740 --> 22:35.790
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.410 --> 22:39.210
The huge mountains...

22:41.920 --> 22:48.840
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.340 --> 22:53.890
It took everything.

22:56.140 --> 23:02.110
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.190 --> 23:09.110
we watched the world ending...

23:09.320 --> 23:15.160
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.290 --> 23:24.960
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:32.180 --> 23:35.850
The forget-me-not... The meaning of this flower is "true love."

23:35.850 --> 23:37.720
What's up with you? What's with the flower?

23:37.720 --> 23:40.560
Nyaah, I just got it.

23:40.560 --> 23:43.610
Giving such a flower to Maron... What a strange person.

23:43.610 --> 23:47.110
Hey, much better than someone else I know...

23:47.110 --> 23:51.030
Where? What kind of person is this? Don't hide, show yourself!

23:51.030 --> 23:54.990
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: Forget-Me-Not Heart Thief

23:55.280 --> 23:59.540
Kaitou Jeanne will absolutely protect "true love!"
